+	 * vmw_user_bo_lookup(), which would otherwise reject it outright
+	 * (see the type-check added there) rather than doing anything
+	 * useful with it. Held across both branches for the same reason
+	 * vmw_prime_resolve_handle()'s other callers hold it: closing the
+	 * race window between resolving the handle and actually using it.
+	 */
